Decision: Schema

Purpose:
  Defines the authoritative schema for decision entities.
  Every decision in the SDDRA system MUST follow this structure.

Schema:
  id: DEC-<ID>
  type: architectural|technical|security|business|operational|human|ai
  status: proposed|approved|rejected|superseded|implemented|verified|closed

  title: <one line>
  context: <why this decision is needed>
  problem: <what problem it solves>

  options:
    - option: <alternative 1>
      pros: [..]
      cons: [..]
      cost: <estimate>
    - option: <alternative 2>
      pros: [..]
      cons: [..]
      cost: <estimate>

  decision: <chosen option>
  rationale: <why this option>

  impact:
    files: [affected paths]
    modules: [affected modules]
    risks: [R0-R5]

  owner: <human or agent id>
  reviewers: [list]
  approved_by: <who approved>
  approved_at: <timestamp>

  implementation:
    tasks: [TASK ids]
    chain: <chain type>
    status: pending|in_progress|completed

  verification:
    criteria: [how to verify]
    status: pending|passed|failed

  supersedes: <previous DEC id if any>
  conflicts: <conflicting DEC ids>
  depends_on: <prerequisite DEC ids>

  created_at: <timestamp>
  updated_at: <timestamp>

Template:
  Decision: DEC-XXX
  Type: <type>
  Status: proposed

  Title: <one line>

  Context:
    <background, why this decision is needed>

  Problem:
    <specific problem statement>

  Options:
    1. <Option A>
       Pros:
         - <pro>
       Cons:
         - <con>
       Cost: <estimate>

    2. <Option B>
       Pros:
         - <pro>
       Cons:
         - <con>
       Cost: <estimate>

    3. <No change>
       Pros:
         - <pro>
       Cons:
         - <con>
       Cost: <estimate>

  Decision:
    <chosen option>

  Rationale:
    <why this option over others>

  Impact:
    Files: [list]
    Modules: [list]
    Risks: [R0-R5 list]

  Owner: <human or agent>
  Reviewers: [list]

  Implementation:
    Tasks: [TASK ids]
    Chain: <chain type>
    Status: pending

  Verification:
    Criteria: [list]
    Status: pending

  Supersedes: null
  Conflicts: null
  Depends_On: null

  Created_At: <timestamp>
  Updated_At: <timestamp>

State: +
